<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_optimum__pow_8hpp">glm/gtx/optimum_pow.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Integer exponentiation of power functions.</para>
</section>
